Package: scanCP
Type: Package
Title: Deep Learning–Based Change Point Detection
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Arman", "Azizyan",
      email = "arman.azizyan@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Tools for simulating, visualizing, and detecting changepoints 
    in univariate and multivariate signals using deep learning and classical statistical 
    methods. Includes utilities for generating piecewise signals, applying 
    rolling-window methods, and integrating MLP-based changepoint detection 
    models.
